==Battleground==
*7 [[Kuromi (Enemy)|Kuromis]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 4~18.67 seconds<sup>120f~560f</sup>.
*3 [[Pochi (Enemy)|Pochis]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2~40 seconds<sup>60f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Setsuko (Enemy)|Setsuko]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nyamusu (Enemy)|Nyamusu]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Kuromi (Enemy)|Kuromis]] spawn, delay 4~12 seconds<sup>120f~360f</sup>.
**1 [[Nebaaru-kun (Enemy)|Nebaaru-kun]] spawns.
**5 [[Kuromi (Enemy)|Kuromis]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**4 [[Pochi (Enemy)|Pochis]] spawn, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Setsuko (Enemy)|Setsukos]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Kuromi (Enemy)|Kuromis]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A somewhat easy stage as the enemies have large amounts of health ranging from 12,000 to 140,000! all of the enemies damage is low but still enough to advance to your base, any hard hitters that are able to almost knockback/kill the enemies are recommended in this level.

